POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ShoppingItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "amount": 3,
  "unit": 3
}

### Adds 500 ml milk, should merge into item 1 and become 1 liter

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ShoppingItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "amount": 500,
  "unit": 2
}

